WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.740
Today we will strengthen performance through reflection. Our work connects with our

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.875
own local community.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.092
Identify one timing or storytelling issue from feedback.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.147
Rehearse a concrete change as a group.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.555
Restage the piece and explain the difference between the two versions.
